! Note: If you view this file through filters.adtity.org and there's a lot of broken text in the file view, feel free to give an upvote to https://github.com/AdguardTeam/FiltersRegistry/issues/1142 if you wish to.
! The included files and what they block in AdGuard and uBO:
! • Dandelion Sprout's Anti-Malware List
! ⌘ IP addresses that host only malware domains and nothing else.
! ⌘ Domains that major tech groups lost the ownership of.
! ⌘ PC "optimiser" sponsorships.
! ⌘ Malicious or tracker-inserting adblockers.
! • Actually Legitimate URL Shortener List
! ⌘ URL parameters believed to be unnecessary or trackers.
! • Social Share List
! ⌘ Non-"Social media" sites' links to social media pages.
! ⌘ "Share page" buttons.
! • I Don't Want to Download Your Browser
! ⌘ "Download [browser/Acrobat]" buttons.
! • Anti-"Snow marketing" List
! ⌘ Falling snow on pages, which are either obstructing the page view, are CPU-intensive, or both.
! • Empty Padding Remover
! ⌘ Gradients when moving your mouse on video embeds.
! ⌘ A few sites' empty whitespace boxes.
! • Anti-"Functionality Removal" List
! ⌘ Attempts to prevent text from being copied, let alone normal copying.
! • Anti-"Prayer Times" List
! ⌘ Prayer time clocks on newssites.
! • Falukorv List
! ⌘ Blockings of sites in lists where there seems to be insufficient reasons to block them.
! ⌘ Failsafes in case any lists have catastrophically miswritten entry syntaxes.
! • Anti-"IMDb on non-IMDb sites" List
! ⌘ Search engines and non-IMDb movie info sites' displaying of IMDb scores, so that users will no longer feel insulted if their favourite shows have a score of around 4.7.
! • Stop Autoplay on Video Sites
! ⌘ Prevents videos from automatically jumping to other and often unrelated videos after having finished.
! • Anti-"Awful comments" List
! ⌘ Certain truly awful comment sections that contain only loud screaming, incoherence, and/or absolute nonsense.
! • Browse Websites Without Logging In
! ⌘ Unnecessary login prompts.
! ⌘ A few sites' gradient blurring of article previews.
! • Dandelion Sprout's African Languages List
! ⌘ Aims to block ads on a few websites that are only in languages that are not widely spoken outside Africa (Swahili, Amharic, Hausa, etc.)
! • Ad Removal List for Unusual Ads
! ⌘ Fake sections on coupon sites that are not actually coupons.
! ⌘ Ads and annoyances that are specific to Windows desktop programs.
! ⌘ Extraordinarily obtrusive premium service banners.
! ⌘ Spammer sections about casinos or slot machines.
! DailyMotion Simplicity / Know Your Meme: Pure Browsing Experience / Wikia: Pure Browsing Experiences
! ⌘ General annoyances on the sites in question.
! • Annoyance List's main file
! ⌘ Certain sites' entry types that are of relevance to pretty no one.
! ⌘ The "Anonymous animal" bubbles on Google Docs.
! ⌘ Obvious honey traps that sites use to detect adblockers.
! ⌘ YouTube's "Recommended for You" entries in the right-side suggestions bar.
! ⌘ Various other oddities.
! • (Windows, macOS, and Linux only) Anti-"Custom Cursors" List
! ⌘ Custom embedded cursors.
! • (Android and iOS only) Staying on the Phone Browser
! ⌘ Mobile app download banners.
! • (Windows only) Japanese Text Softener
! ⌘ Hardcoding by sites to use the worst font ever made (MS PGothic), and rare cases of other bad fonts.
! ⌘ Blurring of a few sites' article previews.
! • (macOS only) Dandelion Sprout's Website Stretcher
! ⌘ Makes some websites use much more of the screen width, instead of just a thin central column.
! What this broad compilation does not block：Newsletters, cookie banners, social media links to companies' pages
